{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2023-04-03 11:05:00', 'title': 'KROGER CELEBRATES EARTH MONTH', 'text': 'GROCER GIVES BACK AND INVITES\xa0 CUSTOMERS TO JOIN EFFORTS TO PROTECT WILDLIFE CINCINNATI , APRIL 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA\'S GROCER, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS CELEBRATING EARTH DAY THE ENTIRE MONTH OF APRIL WITH ITS ZERO HUNGER | ZERO WASTE FOUNDATION MAKING CONTRIBUTIONS TO WORLD WILDLIFE FUND\xa0(WWF) AND THE ARBOR DAY FOUNDATION. "AT KROGER, WE SUPPORT HEALTHY, THRIVING COMMUNITIES DURING EARTH MONTH AND EVERY DAY THROUGH OUR ZERO HUNGER | ZERO WASTE IMPACT PLAN," SAID KEITH DAILEY, KROGER\'S GROUP VICE PRESIDENT OF CORPORATE AFFAIRS AND CHIEF SUSTAINABILITY OFFICER.'}